        "text": "**Developing Login Systems**\n\nI've just finished the groundwork, creating `register_user.py`. Now, I'm shifting gears and delving into `email_password_login.py`, using AWS Cognito to build the login mechanism. I plan to use Cognito to handle the user registration and authentication, enabling them to log in with their email and password.\n\n\n",
