        "text": "**Constructing Identity Client**\n\nI've just initiated the development of `identity_client.py`. This helper file will be responsible for configuring the AWS Cognito client. It is the next step to enabling user authentication and password reset features. I'm focusing on seamless integration now.\n\n\n",
