        "text": "**Defining Identity Models**\n\nOkay, I've got `identity_client.py` built. My next move is to build `identity_models.py`. This helper file will be instrumental in defining the request, response, and normalization helpers specifically tailored for AWS Cognito. It's the next critical step.\n\n\n",
